<article class="env-lemma" id="0EZH">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EZH">Lemma <span data-tag="0EZH">21.30.10</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/0EZ3" data-tag="0EZ3">21.30.1</a>. Let $X$ be in $\mathcal{C}$. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
for $\mathcal{F}'$ in $\mathcal{A}'_ X$ we have $H^ n_{\tau '}(X, \mathcal{F}') = H^ n_\tau (X, \epsilon _ X^{-1}\mathcal{F}')$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
for $K' \in D^+_{\mathcal{A}'_ X}(\mathcal{C}_{\tau '}/X)$ we have $H^ n_{\tau '}(X, K') = H^ n_\tau (X, \epsilon _ X^{-1}K')$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
